WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.502
-I'm here with my man
Kenan Thompson.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.203
Always funny. Congrats.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:08.340
The show premieres Tuesday,
so check out "Kenan."

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.510
Now, Kenan, you've been
on some great TV shows

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.811
and in great movies
over the years,

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.013
but I want to see
if you're a big enough fan

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.983
that you can summarize a movie
or show in just five seconds.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:19.919
It's time for
"5-Second Summaries."

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:24.456
-♪ 1, 2, 3, 4,
5-Second Summaries ♪

00:00:24.456 --> 00:00:25.825
-Oh, here's how the game works.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:28.294
We'll be given the name
of a movie or a TV show.

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:30.663
As soon as you see
the title in your prompter,

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:32.899
you'll have five seconds
to describe the plot

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.167
the best you can

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.502
and try to make me
guess what it is.

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:38.571
But you can't use any words
in the title,

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.508
actors' names, or catchphrases.

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:43.409
You're just describing
the plot of a movie

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:45.611
or the show in five seconds.
That sound good?

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.614
-What about the actor's
character name?

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:48.948
-Nope.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:50.917
-All right.
-Can't do that either.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.251
All right, here we go.
-Alright.

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:53.352
I'm glad I asked.
-We'll take turns.

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:54.653
You're going to go first.

00:00:54.653 --> 00:00:55.955
Are you ready? And...

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.190 line:0%
-Yeah, I'm ready.
-Go.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.594 line:0%
-Uh, sitting on a bench.
Alabama.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.095 line:0%
-"Forrest Gump."
-Chocolate.

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:04.130 line:0%
-"Forrest Gump."
-What?

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:05.398 line:0%
-"Forrest Gump."
-Yes!

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.433 line:0%
Yes!

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.368
-Sitting on a bench.
Not bad, dude.

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:11.771
-Yep.
-Sitting on a bench is...

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:14.074
-That locked it in.
-That was great.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.541
All right. Here's mine.
-A good one.

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:16.675 line:0%
-Can I have five seconds
on the clock?

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:18.044 line:0%
Alright. It's there already.
Here we go.

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:19.545 line:0%
Ready? And...go.

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:25.351 line:0%
Oh, uh, dancing, um, heroin,
cheeseburger, France.

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:27.520 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:30.289 line:0%
-Dancing, heroin,
cheeseburger, France.

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:32.826 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.328 line:0%
I was going to say "Footloose"

00:01:36.328 --> 00:01:37.897 line:0%
just because
that's always dancing,

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:40.133 line:0%
but cheeseburger, France?
No.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.769 line:0%
-That's the one they really
go into, dive into that.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:46.939 line:0%
-Yeah. Cheeseburger, France.

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:48.407 line:0%
No, I don't know that.

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:50.709 line:0%
-"Wonder --"
"Wonder Park." "Wonderland"?

00:01:50.709 --> 00:01:53.112 line:0%
-[ Laughs ] Wonder -- No.

00:01:53.112 --> 00:01:55.014 line:0%
Do you know what they call
a cheeseburger

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:57.617 line:0%
in Paris, or cheeseburger
in France?

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.018 line:0%
-"Pulp Fiction"?

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.353 line:0%
-Yeah.
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:01.554
-"Pulp Fiction."

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:02.822
-All right, here we go.

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:05.758
Oh, I'm just getting word
from the booth.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:06.993
Oh, it's in this ear.

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.895
This round, we're making it
a little tougher.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:10.530
We only have three seconds
to do it.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.397
-Oh, goody.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:12.632
-Movie or TV shows.

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.734
Let's put three seconds
on the clock.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:15.835
Ready?
-Alright.

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:17.270 line:0%
-And go.

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:20.339 line:0%
-Aah! Ssss!

00:02:20.339 --> 00:02:22.407 line:0%
Eek!
[ Buzzer ]

00:02:22.407 --> 00:02:23.643 line:0%
-Oh! "Snakes on a Plane"!

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.478 line:0%
[ Bell dings ]
-Boom!

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:27.780 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.615
-That's right --
I have pajama pants on

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:31.150
underneath my suit.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:34.387
-[ Laughs ]
Are you wearing pajama pants?

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:36.122
-For the next scene I got to do.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.024
-Watch you bring that back.
I'm telling you right now.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:40.927
Bring it back?
Watch you start that.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:41.995
That's going to be a thing.

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.395
-Yeah, pajama pants
and suits, man.

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:44.463
-Alright. Here we go.

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:46.032 line:0%
You got three seconds up there.

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:48.267 line:0%
[ Chuckles ] Here we go.
One, two. Here we go.

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.770 line:0%
Oh, uh, "Kick him in the leg."

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.237 line:0%
Uh...

00:02:52.237 --> 00:02:53.706 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]
-"Karate Kid."

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:55.241 line:0%
"Karate Kid"?
[ Bell dings ]

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.442 line:0%
-Ish.

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:58.011 line:0%
-Oh, uh, uh, uh...

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.845 line:0%
the, uh, the TV show is, uh,

00:02:59.845 --> 00:03:02.081 line:0%
is "Kuma Kai," "Kuma Kai,"
"Cobra Kai."

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:03.248 line:0%
[ Bell dings ]
"Cobra Kai."

00:03:03.248 --> 00:03:04.950 line:0%
-We accepted "Kuma Kai."
I love it.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.853
-"Kuma Kai."
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.554
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:10.523
I'm thinking of the Van Damme
movie -- "Bloodsport."

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.458
-Yeah, that is
a Van Damme movie.

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:14.026
-"Cobra Kai."

00:03:14.026 --> 00:03:15.227
-Final round this time.

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:17.563 line:0%
Let's put one second
on the clock. What?

00:03:17.563 --> 00:03:19.698 line:0%
Is that possible?
-Oh, God.

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:21.267 line:0%
-This is --
Pressure's on for this one.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:23.269 line:0%
One second, that's barely --
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:26.405 line:0%
-[ Tapping desk ]
...time to do anything.

00:03:26.405 --> 00:03:28.574 line:0%
-Mm.
-Okay.

00:03:28.574 --> 00:03:31.243 line:0%
Phew! It's about to
come on your prompter.

00:03:31.243 --> 00:03:33.612 line:0%
-Okay.
-Ready?

00:03:33.612 --> 00:03:34.980 line:0%
Go.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.650 line:0%
-Uh, nurses forever!

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.851 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:41.054 line:0%
-"Cocoon"? "E.R."

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:42.655 line:0%
-Nurses forever.
-"E.R."

00:03:43.889 --> 00:03:45.357 line:0%
-Nurses for--
-Even longer.

00:03:45.357 --> 00:03:47.560 line:0%
-Nurses for-ever?

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:48.794 line:0%
-Yeah.
-Oh, man.

00:03:48.794 --> 00:03:51.096 line:0%
"E.R." was on for a while.

00:03:51.096 --> 00:03:52.298 line:0%
Oh, "Grey's Anatomy."

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:53.966 line:0%
[ Bell dings ]

00:03:53.966 --> 00:03:56.735 line:0%
-See that? Look at that.

00:03:56.735 --> 00:03:58.137
So, who wins?
-Look at that.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.272
If anyone from
the future sees this,

00:04:00.272 --> 00:04:01.740
look at that.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:02.975
-Look at that.
-Just look at that.

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:05.444
You want to see something?
Watch this.

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:08.114
People show it, bleep-blurp it
onto their eyeglasses.

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:10.183
-Oh. Oh, wow.
Look at that.

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:12.351
He got it in one second.
-They got it in one second.

00:04:12.351 --> 00:04:14.653 line:0%
All right.
[ Clears throat ]

00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:16.055 line:0%
All right, ready? One second.

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:17.556 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:04:17.556 --> 00:04:19.726 line:0%
-Oh. Uh, a spinning top.

00:04:21.126 --> 00:04:22.895 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:25.097 line:0%
This is --
-Spinning top.

00:04:25.097 --> 00:04:26.666 line:0%
-How would I even --
-Spinning top.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:30.403 line:0%
I can't describe this
in 20 minutes.

00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:32.105 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:35.208 line:0%
In 20 minutes?
I'm going with "Bridgerton."

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.477 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:41.747 line:0%
No, this is -- it's a movie.

00:04:41.747 --> 00:04:43.349 line:0%
-This is a movie.

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:45.684 line:0%
But I was thinking about
how to describe it,

00:04:45.684 --> 00:04:47.420 line:0%
and that's how I would
probably --

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.889 line:0%
Without giving away anything,
that's --

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:52.725 line:0%
Right? Spinning -- Didn't --

00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.160 line:0%
-"Harry Potter"?

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.761 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]
[ Buzzer ]

00:04:55.761 --> 00:04:57.429 line:0%
"Inception."
-Come on.

00:04:57.429 --> 00:05:00.199 line:0%
-"Inception."
-"Inception."

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:02.602 line:0%
[ Bell dings ]
The spinning top.

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:03.636 line:0%
That's a good one.

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:05.771
Is it, though?
-That's a good clue.

00:05:05.771 --> 00:05:07.339
I'm going to give you
the win on this.

00:05:07.339 --> 00:05:09.175
Congratulations, Kenan Thompson
right there!

00:05:09.175 --> 00:05:10.209
